From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: add eCash mined-header encoding and overlay
 reconstruction

Add compact MinedHeader (header + coinbase) wire serialization and O(1)
candidate overlay block reconstruction.

Original-Commit: af0a6267e2c91d8442fd7473fe158cd1ec28ccac
Original-Patch: ecash/009
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Repair: Register blocksnap.cpp with its first MinedHeader caller. Preserve legacy eCash positional Merkle verification and existing positive/negative native encoding tests; protocol-handler integration remains a separate concern.

Plan-v2 owner repair: B1: reconstructed blocks retain ordinary Merkle mutation validation.

